          "text": "GATE 4 — RUNTIME  (Terraform-held config, Azure Policy, scheduled workflows in the platform repo)\nIngress always authenticated · images from platform registry only · required tags · resource bounds\nHeartbeat every 15 min as monitoring identity (3 misses = down) · weekly image rescan · daily Fabric checks\nMonthly: owner still enabled; app roles and shortcuts still ⊆ owner · traffic-vs-signin signal · cert expiry watch"
        },
