          },
          "text": "OPEN QUESTION, detail (red box, GitHub lane) — Today 03-skills has new-citizen-app run git init + gh repo create at scaffold time, so the repo exists before any code is written (GitHub first). Alternative: deploy-citizen-app creates the repo on the first deploy (as part of push), so scaffolding needs no gh login and the admission PR and repo appear together. Affects the prerequisite check, D19 (how skills reach developers), D20 (repo settings), and when Gate 1 can start. Not yet recorded as open in 04-decisions."
        },
        {
          "id": "noteCred",
          "type": "rectangle",
          "boundingBox": {
            "x": 630,
            "y": 1130,
