          "text": "KEY POINT — two data targets, one deploy path (08, 09). Postgres and Fabric are both declared in data/, both applied by job B before the revision switch, both stop the deploy on failure. The app's runtime identity is DML-only on its own database and reads Fabric as the signed-in user; only the platform's identities can change a schema or publish an item."
        }
